WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.875 --> 00:00:02.702
Oh, hi! I'm Ray,

2
00:00:02.762 --> 00:00:05.276
the stingray who lives inside Fabricator.

3
00:00:05.433 --> 00:00:07.411
Building a Rayfin app usually means

4
00:00:07.471 --> 00:00:11.637
juggling CLIs, Copilot, git and a browser…

5
00:00:11.697 --> 00:00:14.589
whoa. The room is spinning.

6
00:00:15.084 --> 00:00:18.051
Fabricator puts it all in one window.

7
00:00:18.333 --> 00:00:20.386
Name your app, and I'll swim it over to

8
00:00:20.446 --> 00:00:23.103
Microsoft Fabric. Hey, that's me!

9
00:00:23.163 --> 00:00:24.470
Fins crossed.

10
00:00:24.696 --> 00:00:27.337
And on deploy, Rayfin sets up your whole

11
00:00:27.397 --> 00:00:30.507
backend, automatically: database, APIs,

12
00:00:30.567 --> 00:00:33.186
auth, storage, functions and hosting.

13
00:00:33.246 --> 00:00:34.394
Scalable, governed,

14
00:00:34.454 --> 00:00:36.658
and inside your organization's boundary.

15
00:00:36.718 --> 00:00:38.553
You didn't lift a fin.

16
00:00:39.200 --> 00:00:40.914
Then describe what you want,

17
00:00:40.974 --> 00:00:42.385
in plain English.

18
00:00:42.445 --> 00:00:44.808
GitHub Copilot writes the code…

19
00:00:45.540 --> 00:00:47.148
and I cheer!

20
00:00:47.700 --> 00:00:49.225
Your app runs live,

21
00:00:49.285 --> 00:00:50.659
right next to the chat.

22
00:00:50.719 --> 00:00:52.017
See something to change?

23
00:00:52.077 --> 00:00:54.365
Point at it in Design, and ask.

24
00:00:54.900 --> 00:00:56.953
After every successful chat turn,

25
00:00:57.013 --> 00:00:59.075
Fabricator redeploys your app.

26
00:00:59.353 --> 00:01:01.783
It's live! Then share it with people in

27
00:01:01.843 --> 00:01:03.150
your organization.

28
00:01:03.400 --> 00:01:05.680
The Advisor grades your app's health.

29
00:01:05.740 --> 00:01:07.914
History keeps every change.

30
00:01:07.982 --> 00:01:09.302
And if something breaks,

31
00:01:09.362 --> 00:01:11.348
I'll dig through the logs with you.

32
00:01:11.667 --> 00:01:13.909
It runs on the GitHub Copilot account you

33
00:01:13.969 --> 00:01:16.135
already have. Download Fabricator,

34
00:01:16.195 --> 00:01:17.577
and come say hi!

35
00:01:18.629 --> 00:01:21.006
Psst… a group of stingrays is called a

36
00:01:21.066 --> 00:01:24.410
fever. I'm not making that up.
